@startuml
title UmbraRo, Cognito sign-up and token exchange (first-time user)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName Inter

actor "Coach" as U
participant "UmbraRo app\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "AWS Cognito" as Cog
participant "Amazon SES" as SES
participant "FastAPI backend\n(App Runner)" as API
database "RDS\nPostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : Enter name, email,\npassword, team
App -> Cog : signUp(email, password, name)
Cog -> SES : Send 6-digit code
SES --> U : Verification email
U -> App : Enter 6-digit code
App -> Cog : confirmSignUp(email, code)
Cog --> App : Confirmed

App -> Cog : signIn(email, password)
Cog --> App : Cognito ID token

App -> API : POST /auth/register_with_cognito\n{ team_name }
API -> Cog : GET /.well-known/jwks.json  (cached 1h)
Cog --> API : JWKS public keys
API -> API : Verify ID token (RS256),\nread sub + email
API -> DB : INSERT user (email, cognito_sub,\nteam_name, full_name)
DB --> API : user row
API --> App : { access_token, refresh_token }\n(local JWT pair)

App -> API : GET /auth/me
API -> DB : SELECT user by id
DB --> API : user
API --> App : Profile (UserResponse)
App --> U : Signed in (dashboard)

note over App, API
  Returning user: signIn, then POST /auth/cognito
  returns the same JWT pair (matched by cognito_sub or email).
end note
@enduml
